    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-6 leading-tight">ChatGPT or Claude: how to use them in B2B and industrial marketing</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">A practical guide for marketing teams at manufacturers: how to choose between the two, prompts that work for technical content, and the checks AI can't do for you.</p>
